          "text": "\ud83d\udea8\ud83d\udd25Holy crap! Ukraine struck the Kerch Bridge overnight with Flamingo cruise missiles, dealing a double blow to Putin: destroying a critical Russian military supply route into occupied Crimea and shattering one of the most visible symbols of his illegal annexation.\n\nGlory to Ukraine! \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\udde6"
